  "display_fullname": "Controller Control QUOAstral Control Ambiguity",
  "display_help": "You create a breakdown between the wall of dreams and reality at the targeted location, so subtle that foes may not even notice. These changes Repel them from the center of the power, repositioning them without arousing suspicion. Enemies repositioned by Ambiguity will suffer a minor penalty to their ToHit and Perception for a long time after the Ambiguity has faded.",
